oute comes with a fixed written milestone fee agreed before work begins, separated transparently from mandatory government and biometric tariffs."},{"question":"How does your team manage document translation and apostilles?","answer":"We coordinate certified translations and Hague Convention apostilles across forty-two civil registries so documents meet exact consular format on first submission."}],"allowMultipleOpen":false,"emitSchemaOrg":true},"style":[]}]}]}]}],"settings":{"designCollection":"meridian","designBlock":"faq"}}]}